      "spam": false,
      "value": "Thought about afk (technically Away from Controller/Rig/HMD) auto detect early on. It's a nice thought but there's just too many cases where you might not want to appear afk and it puts you in that mode like sitting in a talk show then it looks like crowd is gone AFK. It'd be a lot of effort for us and much easier to select and afk avatar that doesn't crumple into a pile when you put down hmd and hands and mute yourself which is what I do now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
