      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6d558ff44e44ada717902|full_name}: So set an option to disable AFK detection. Just because you personally don't want it doesn't mean we shouldn't get it. That's a joke. it'd be great if the status could have an option for \"AFK\" when it detects no activity for a while. Sometimes we set out HMD down to go eat and don't come back or whatever",
