  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's nice that we can manually change to an \"AFK Avatar\" on the core VRChat list now, but I think it would be good too that VRChat would detect the player being AFK after a certain timer (like 1h-2h) by no keyboard/controller actions ingame and  movement - it would stamp a \"AFK Tag\" or icon next to our nametag.\n\nWhen we return from AFK it would just make it disappear and can even have a small sound to it just cause.",
